<title>USA: Edison Brothers Stores same-store sales lower.</title>
<headline>Edison Brothers Stores same-store sales lower.</headline>
<dateline>ST LOUIS, Mo. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edison Brothers Stores Inc said on Thursday that same-store sales for the four weeks ended November 30 fell 2.9 percent to $81.4 million from $83.8 million for the four weeks ended December 2, 1995.</p>
